ut and your groin and if you don't  treat it  it might enter the bloodstream and  spread to your organs  outside your body the dirt and grime  would be  building up on layers of dead skin  your skin would dehydrate causing it to  flake and itch  sebum the oil on your skin would build  up causing  acne across your face chest and back  your skin could harden and thicken to  fight the infection  developing into a condition called  hyperkeratosis  this dense protective layer would be  made of keratin  the same proteins found in your hair any  exposed skin would turn dark scaly and  rough  leading to a disorder called dermatitis  neglecta  this inflammatory skin condition is a  direct result  of your not bathing and  since you're not dealing with this  primary infection  it would lead to secondary infections  across your body  your immune system would be compromised  you would need a steady supply of  antibiotics to treat these illnesses  but most doctors only prescribe this  medication  for two weeks and since you're taking so  many antibiotics to fight off your  chronic infections  your body would build up a resistance to  the drugs  a 2013 study by the centers for disease  control and prevention found that  almost 2 million people in the united  states get an antibiotic resistant  infection  every year and at least 23  000 of those people die oh and another  noticeable sign of your decay  your matted hair not washing your hair  for weeks  may lead to it becoming thicker with  more volume but  with the bacteria building up from the  moisture on your scalp  after several days your hair might smell  like sour milk  your hands would show how infectious  your skin has become but  it's the part you don't see that's  getting worse  that part under your shirt in a 2012  study published in  plos one researchers found  2 368 species of bacteria  living inside people's belly buttons  and 1500 of those bacteria  may be new to science whether you're an  innie or an audi your dirty belly button  would become  an ecosystem that would rival the amazon  oh and we're assuming that if you're not  washing yourself  you're not washing your clothes either  every stain on the fabric would press  against your skin  this constant contact with the dirty  fibers would irritate your skin  leading to dermatitis the rash  would leave you red and flaky and  since you never bathed your sweat would  mix with your dead skin cells and dirt  soon your body odor would become  obnoxious  keeping everyone away from you so  you'd have plenty of time for yourself  you know according to the centers for  disease control and prevention  the average person showers for eight  minutes  so if you stopped showering you'd gain  an extra two days each year to do  whatever you wanted and with all that  time to yourself  you could check out the content on  curiositystream  the sponsors of this episode  curiositystream  offers thousands of documentaries  non-fiction titles and  exclusive content from some of the  world's best filmmakers  get unlimited access starting at just  2.99 a month  or 19.99 a year you could reflect on  your isolation with the documentary  mustang journey of transformation it's a  really cool exploration of one of the  last  buddhist sanctuaries tucked away in the  himalayas  or check out hidden japan learn about  the thousands of diverse  islands and habitats that might offer  you a new start  curiosity stream is available worldwide  so  as long as you have a signal you can  watch on your smartphone or  other streaming devices and for what if  viewers  you get the first 30 days completely  free when you sign up at  curiositystream what if  and use the promo code what if sign up  now and start your journey  into the unknown today but  your new hobbies should be the least of  your concerns  the way you stink you wouldn't be able  to hold a job unless it's  remote and don't count on keeping a  roommate  or a romantic partner with the  self-imposed  isolation a